{"rpid": "278138582128", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "明可侍奉", "mid": "3546712482253726", "level": 4, "vip": 0, "content": "什么盔甲都有一些东西没有铁甲这种东西，现在才知道欧洲的板甲和中国的铠甲完全就不同，真的说实话", "like": 0, "ctime": 1759623509, "rcount": 0, "ip": "河南", "images": [], "video_aid": "219802", "video_bvid": "BV1px411w7N6", "video_title": "中国盔甲进化史", "video_desc": "youku 中国盔甲进化史", "video_owner": "GhostInTheShadow", "video_view": 25599, "video_reply": 84, "video_n1": 44, "video_n2": 40}
